# Topic ACL of the triplet broker: each layer writes only its own topics (SEC-4).
# A layer that is compromised or misconfigured cannot impersonate another one on the bus;
# the HMAC envelope then protects the content end to end.

# --- City Brain: everything under brain/ (internal topics, commands, events, errors, status)
user brain
topic readwrite brain/#
topic read twin/#
topic read city/#
topic read guardian/#

# --- Twin: city readings and calls, its meta, actuator / unit acknowledgements, status
user twin
topic write city/#
topic write twin/#
topic read brain/cmd/#
topic read brain/status
topic read brain/error
topic read twin/control

# --- Guardian: verdicts, quarantines, status; reads the same data as the Brain
user guardian
topic write guardian/#
topic read city/#
topic read twin/#
topic read brain/cmd/#
topic read brain/alert
topic read brain/status
topic read brain/error
topic read guardian/control

# --- Scenario runner (tests only): drives the mocks, observes everything, writes nothing else
user tester
topic write twin/control
topic write guardian/control
topic write brain/control/#
topic read #
